<title>FRANCE: BoF declines comment on reported mark sales.</title>
<headline>BoF declines comment on reported mark sales.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France declined comment on reports by currency dealers in London that it had sold marks for francs at 3.4300 per mark in early European trading.</p>
</text>
